	image.75E904842B299F08.title: "&dTier IV · Occult Era · World Tier: Ascent"
	image.75F6B327BF2FFE70.title: "&6Tier II · Brass Era · crushing wheels and ores"
	image.7614D5DF86F95E19.title: "&cSteam and Steel Era · Keys and Treasure"
	image.76ED257303102332.title: "&6Tier III · Occult Era · steam boilers"
	image.7746835EF959C83E.title: "&cTier IV · Atomic Era · The Ender Dragon"
	image.777C5F8FE5E55C23.title: "&dArcane Era · Niter: Fermentation and Digestion"
